{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026dzSZYT2xCN1794542959.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>微軟出現系統故障，影響電郵等服務，至少十多萬用戶報告受影響。本港不少商業機構都受影響，電郵Outlook帳戶凌晨起一直未能開啟。</p><p></p><p>港交所亦通報，由於微軟的全球系統出現故障，港交所電郵服務目前受到影響，至於所有市場就正常運作。港交所指會監察情況，適時提供最新消息。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T05:16:14.876141+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T03:29:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T23:43:01.395413+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T05:09:34.309111+00:00","content_hash":"e1d4b1ba0475e9ecbf1b8cfefec6458c163105e65e616abf44049e104e3c735a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T05:16:14.876141+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}